  "instructions": [
    "Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil and cook the pasta according to the package instructions.",
    "In a large skillet, heat the olive oil over medium heat and add the tadka spices.",
    "Add the shredded Grana Padano cheese to the skillet and stir until melted and smooth.",
    "Add the honey, apple sauce, salt, and black pepper to the skillet and stir until well combined.",
    "Drain the cooked pasta and add it to the skillet, tossing to coat with the cheese sauce.",
    "Transfer the pasta to a slate-tile vessel and top with chopped fresh parsley.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy.",
    "Garnish with additional parsley if desired."
